  "text": "54 Rathdown Street,\nCARLTON.\n9th June, 1955.\nc. E. McFadyen, Esq.,\nSecretar Shipping & Transport,\nDept. of\n497 Collins St.,\nMELBOURNE, C.1.\nDear Charles,\nIt was with great pleasure I read in\n\"Sun\" this morning that you have been awarded\nthe C.B.E. Believe me Charles I am thrilled\nreceived this honor which is a high one and\none in my opinion that you deserve.\nCongratulations and Best Wishes,\nYours sincerely,\ns. V. Lunch",
